>also Here's a more general question about NN (NoNews)
>How do i SUSCRIBE to a group?
>ie. i want to suscribe to rec.games.hack 

While in NN (i.e. while reading a newsgroup) type G.  The capital G is the
GOTO prompt, and it will respond with file, folder, newsgroup, or some such
thing.  Just type rec.games.hack, and press return.  You will jump to
rec.games.hack.  Now type U.  Since you are already unsubscribed to r.g.h.,
it will inform you of such, and ask if you'd like to resubscribe (y/n).
Easy as that.  Of course, this applies to the version of NN I'm using; I
can only assume your version is compatible....

